# Placeholder. Some networks (corporate proxies, antivirus HTTPS scanning)
# re-sign TLS connections, which makes pip inside the build unable to verify
# pypi.org. Point EXTRA_CA_FILE at that network's root CA to add it to the
# image's trust store for the build only:
#
#   EXTRA_CA_FILE=./docker/local-ca.pem docker compose build api
#
# Nothing is committed: docker/local-ca.pem is gitignored. Leaving this file
# as the default is a no-op.
